    "title": "PUSD advances toward $3M grant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago PARLIER – Continuing its promising streak of districtwide improvements, Parlier Unified is now one step closer to its next facility restoration project. During the Feb. 10 Parlier Unified School District board meeting, Superintendent Rafael Iniguez announced that the district received a passing score for a competitive $3 million career technical education grant. Assuming the district makes it through the final filtering process, the grant will be put toward restoring the historic Fantz Environmental Center, bringing new experiences and opportunities for students. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
